{"seq":2,"slug":"barcode-coverage-quality","title":"条码覆盖率与数据质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gtin-product-identity-masterdata/identity-masterdata-ops/barcode-coverage-quality","wordCount":1624,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"条码覆盖率与数据质量\">条码覆盖率与数据质量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「条码覆盖率」是商品主数据里最容易被滥用的指标——因为它太容易被一个口径定义得好看。定义错了口径，覆盖率可以做到 100% 同时毫无意义；定义得能反映现实，它才会稳定在 80%–95% 之间并持续暴露问题。</p>\n<p>覆盖率的第一条原则是：<strong>分母必须只包含「应当有 GTIN」的商品</strong>。自有品牌白牌、定制商品、服务类商品、按需制作商品本来就不该有 GTIN，把它们算进分母会永久拉低指标，并直接诱导运营去「补」一个不该有的号（见 <a href=\"../gtin-barcode-standard/mpn-brand-identifier-relation\">MPN/品牌与内部 SKU 关系</a> 里的 <code>gtin_required</code>）。渠道侧的规范同样确认了这个豁免范围：GTIN「对所有由制造商分配了 GTIN 的商品都推荐提供」，而店铺自有品牌、白标、独家销售与定制商品不需要（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324461\">Merchant Center 规范</a>）。第二条原则是：<strong>覆盖率是分层指标而不是单一数字</strong>——按品类、渠道、供应商、生命周期阶段分别看，才能定位到问题来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  ALL[全部商品记录] --&gt; EX{应当有 GTIN?}&#10;  EX --&gt;|否 白牌/定制/服务| EXCL[排除出分母]&#10;  EX --&gt;|是| DEN[覆盖率分母]&#10;  DEN --&gt; V{号码状态}&#10;  V --&gt;|有效且未退役| NUM[覆盖率分子]&#10;  V --&gt;|缺失| G1[缺口: 从未分配]&#10;  V --&gt;|校验位错| G2[缺口: 数据错误]&#10;  V --&gt;|受限号段| G3[缺口: 结构性滥用]&#10;  V --&gt;|已退役仍在售| G4[缺口: 退役未同步]&#10;  NUM --&gt; LAYER[分层: 品类/渠道/供应商/阶段]&#10;  G1 --&gt; WF[修复工单]&#10;  G2 --&gt; WF&#10;  G3 --&gt; WF&#10;  G4 --&gt; WF\">graph TD\n  ALL[全部商品记录] --&gt; EX{应当有 GTIN?}\n  EX --&gt;|否 白牌/定制/服务| EXCL[排除出分母]\n  EX --&gt;|是| DEN[覆盖率分母]\n  DEN --&gt; V{号码状态}\n  V --&gt;|有效且未退役| NUM[覆盖率分子]\n  V --&gt;|缺失| G1[缺口: 从未分配]\n  V --&gt;|校验位错| G2[缺口: 数据错误]\n  V --&gt;|受限号段| G3[缺口: 结构性滥用]\n  V --&gt;|已退役仍在售| G4[缺口: 退役未同步]\n  NUM --&gt; LAYER[分层: 品类/渠道/供应商/阶段]\n  G1 --&gt; WF[修复工单]\n  G2 --&gt; WF\n  G3 --&gt; WF\n  G4 --&gt; WF</pre><h2 id=\"指标定义\">指标定义</h2><h3 id=\"覆盖率与它的四种缺口\">覆盖率与它的四种缺口</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>coverage</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>有效 GTIN 的在售商品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>应当有 GTIN 的在售商品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{coverage} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{有效 GTIN 的在售商品}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{应当有 GTIN 的在售商品}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coverage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应当有</span><span class=\"mord\"> GTIN </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的在售商品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效</span><span class=\"mord\"> GTIN </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的在售商品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四种缺口的修复成本与责任人完全不同，因此<strong>不能只报一个总覆盖率</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺口类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>责任人</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从未分配</td>\n<td>GTIN 为空</td>\n<td>新品未走发号流程</td>\n<td>商品主数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据错误</td>\n<td>校验位不通过 / 长度异常</td>\n<td>手工录入、Excel 变形</td>\n<td>数据工程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性滥用</td>\n<td>落在受限号段</td>\n<td>号源不明、二手条码</td>\n<td>合规 / 品牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退役未同步</td>\n<td>号码已退役但仍在售</td>\n<td>换号流程未闭环</td>\n<td>渠道运营</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"除覆盖率外的质量维度\">除覆盖率外的质量维度</h3><p>覆盖率只回答「有没有」，不回答「对不对」。完整的数据质量维度至少还要包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>校验位通过率</td>\n<td>通过校验位的 GTIN / 非空 GTIN</td>\n<td>接近 100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一码多用检出数</td>\n<td>同一活跃 GTIN 下规格指纹不唯一的条数</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段完整率</td>\n<td>必填属性齐全的商品 / 全部应有商品</td>\n<td>分品类定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步时延</td>\n<td>内部变更 → 渠道可见的中位/尾部时延</td>\n<td>按协议约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射健康度</td>\n<td>primary 覆盖率、candidate 积压、区间断裂数</td>\n<td>待复核积压趋零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意「同步时延」要用<strong>尾部值</strong>（如 P95）而不是均值：一次卡住的同步会毁掉一个渠道的上新节奏，而均值会把它平均掉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不能只考核一个数字\">为什么不能只考核一个数字</h3><p>如果 KPI 只有「覆盖率」，理性行为就是给白牌商品也编一个号，或者把分母口径改成只统计「已有 GTIN 的商品」。这是典型的指标腐化（metric gaming）。防御方式是<strong>口径冻结 + 多指标交叉</strong>：分母口径写进代码与文档并在变更时留痕，同时把「受限号段占用数」「校验位通过率」放在同一张看板上——它们的方向是相反的，无法同时优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取数与实现\">取数与实现</h2><h3 id=\"分层取数\">分层取数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分层覆盖率：按品类 / 渠道 / 供应商 / 生命周期阶段&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT s.sku_id, s.category_code, s.supplier_id, s.lifecycle_stage,&#10;         s.gtin_required,&#10;         l.gtin14,&#10;         g.retired_at,&#10;         validate_gtin(l.gtin14, b.brand_owner_gln).verdict AS verdict&#10;  FROM merchant_sku s&#10;  LEFT JOIN sku_gtin_link l&#10;         ON l.sku_id = s.sku_id AND l.link_type = &#39;primary&#39; AND l.valid_to IS NULL&#10;  LEFT JOIN product_identity_gtin g ON g.gtin14 = l.gtin14&#10;  LEFT JOIN brand_entity b ON b.brand_id = s.brand_id&#10;  WHERE s.status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#39;category&#39; AS dim, category_code AS key, count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required) AS denom,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required AND verdict = &#39;PASS&#39; AND retired_at IS NULL) AS numer,&#10;       round(count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required AND verdict=&#39;PASS&#39; AND retired_at IS NULL)::numeric&#10;             / nullif(count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required),0), 4) AS coverage&#10;FROM base GROUP BY category_code&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT &#39;supplier&#39;, supplier_id::text, count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required),&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required AND verdict=&#39;PASS&#39; AND retired_at IS NULL),&#10;       round(count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required AND verdict=&#39;PASS&#39; AND retired_at IS NULL)::numeric&#10;             / nullif(count(*) FILTER (WHERE gtin_required),0), 4)&#10;FROM base GROUP BY supplier_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分层覆盖率：按品类 / 渠道 / 供应商 / 生命周期阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lifecycle_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin_required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retired_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         validate_gtin(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">brand_owner_gln</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verdict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_sku s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_gtin_link l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">link_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'primary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_identity_gtin g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin14</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin14</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand_entity b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">brand_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">brand_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'category'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim, category_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gtin_required) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gtin_required </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PASS'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#